{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107905","id":2612385410,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6btdaC","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107905","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107905.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107905.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107905","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107905/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107905/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107905/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/004dd69418b00cce634d7c2e72ac34e8679ab752","number":107905,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Expose multi_mesh_rid in CPUParticles3D to allow custom rendering via RenderingDevice","user":{"login":"J-Ponzo","id":32590977,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTkwOTc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32590977?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo","html_url":"https://github.com/J-Ponzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Description\r\nI’m implementing a custom renderer using the RenderingDevice API. So far, I’ve managed to support both static meshes and skeletal meshes. I would now like to support CPUParticles3D as well.\r\n\r\nMy approach is to let Godot handle the particle simulation, then use the RenderingServer to fetch the transforms and colors of each instance through:\r\n```gdscript\r\nRenderingServer.multimesh_instance_get_transform(multi_mesh_rid, idx)\r\nRenderingServer.multimesh_instance_get_color(multi_mesh_rid, idx)\r\n```\r\nHowever, the internal `RID multimesh;` of the `CPUParticles3D` node is currently private, which makes this impossible.\r\n\r\n# What this PR does\r\nThis PR simply adds a getter for the internal MultiMesh RID (multimesh) and exposes it to scripts using:\r\n```gdscript\r\nClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"get_multimesh_rid\"), &CPUParticles3D::get_multimesh_rid);\r\n```\r\nThis allows users to integrate `CPUParticles3D` into custom renderers without having to reimplement particle simulation.\r\n\r\n# Tests:\r\n- Code compiles and runs correctly.\r\n- Works in a simple POC project\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ba1cad7-6408-45ea-888b-10e5e91c9743)\r\n\r\n# Personal Note:\r\nThis is my first pull request to the Godot Engine. I’ve read the [Pull Request Workflow](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/workflow/pr_workflow.html), and while I’m not an advanced Git user, I’m eager to learn and happy to make any requested changes.\r\n\r\nThanks for your time and for maintaining such an awesome engine\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-23T18:00:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:22Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"818a8f5f8cfa765a5c3a6f53dbab6ae554a2fd8c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_rev